Build only ICU4X's bakeddata and codegen tools. bakeddata reads local source
data (ICU4X_CLDR_DIR, ICU4X_ICUEXPORT_DIR) instead of downloading it, and builds
code point tries with the system ICU4C instead of its prebuilt WebAssembly
module. codegen needs compiled data only for property names, not all of ICU4X's
baked data.

